# Pre-release license notice

This repository is being prepared for a public dataset release. It currently contains documentation and empty directory placeholders only; no dataset files are being licensed or distributed at this stage.

Before Version 1.0.0 is published, the data owners will select and publish an explicit data-use license. CC BY 4.0 is the proposed default, subject to confirmation of ownership, institutional approval, and farm permissions.

Until this file is replaced by the final license, no license is granted for future dataset contents.
